OL,3,AFans praise 'perfect' ending as anime
OL,4,Aseries Bleach officially ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's a finale fans have waited more
OL,7,Fthan a decade to see.
OL,9,FThe epic conclusion to Bleach, the
OL,10,Fpopular animated series based on the
OL,11,Fhit manga, or Japanese comic, has
OL,12,Farrived - and early reactions have
OL,13,Fdescribed it is as a "perfect" ending.
OL,15,FAnticipation for the final episode of
OL,16,Fthe climactic Thousand-Year Blood War
OL,17,Fstoryline was especially high.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
